  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> has bond order 2.5.<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> has bond order 2.0.<br />In <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> has bond order 1.5.<br />Higher the bond order, smaller is the bond length.<br />Hence, the order is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> .",
